@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Liberation Serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
hide empty members
participant "Job" as P0
participant "Source GitHub" as P1
participant "Docker SDK" as P2
participant "Backend" as P3
participant "DB quản lý" as P4
P0 -> P0: chờ buildGate
P0 -> P1: Archive(repo, SHA)
P1 -> P0: tar đã sanitise
P0 -> P2: ImageBuild; labels revision
P0 -> P2: NetworkCreate + dependency
P0 -> P2: waitHealthy
P0 -> P2: create/start app
P0 -> P3: GET /actuator/health
P3 -> P0: 200; status UP
P0 -> P4: Save RUNNING + expiry
@enduml